-at the section that displays AVAX,BTC,BCH,TAO,BNB,CC,ADA,LINK,CRO,DAI,DOGE,USDE these crypto(assets) data should be dynamic and fetched from the db and when any symbol is clicked it's chat shows up in the tradeview chart as it already does with the static data
-after the tradeview chart in the section where the type of trade can be selected Live or Demo trade
-when on live the Live Bal $11,500.00 which is the user balance should be dynamic while for when on the demo each user should have a  Demo Bal $10,100.00 which is 10,100.00 of which every currency the user account is 
-under te Asset Class section the assets under the category of  Crypto,Forex,Stocks,ETFs, Indices when these filters are clicked and each assets under any category selected should fetch all assets under that category to populate the options in the Select Asset input field

now when the trade form is field like select live or demo, binary or spot, select asset and the selected asset prices displays on the readonly field of entry price, leverage selected, amount
-now when binary is selected the form ui provides the duration field when spot is selected it doesn't 
and it already calculates in the Order Summary section the Est. Fee (0.1%), Leverage, Potential P/L, the outcome calcultion is powered by the leverage and the amount inputted in real-time

-when the form is field and sbmitted successfully it redirects to same page and it displays Trade executed successfully. You can review the details in your trade history.
the amount of the trade is deducted from the user balance if it's a live trade but if it's a demo trade is deducted from the Demo Bal
 -user recieves this notification below in it's dashboard notification modal
Title: Trade Opened
Message: You opened a buy trade on INTC — Intel Corporation(dynamic based on the name of the asset) for $120.00(dynamic based on amount of the trade).
Time: 21 hours ago(dynamic)
icon: bell icon 
link named view details leads to the  /user/notification.html page where all history are displayed 

-when there is no trade with the status of open here is the template display in the under trade.html
-when the trade duration elaspse the trade is close and the positive PL which is the profit that is caluclated earlier is added to the trade  
