-when the delete button is clicked there's a window.prompt alert saying Delete wallet?
This action cannot be undone. when the ok button is clicked and the form submitted successfully and it redirects back and it display Wallet deleted Sucessful!

//digital-grownt\frontend\admin\mwalletsettings.html
mwalletsettings.html:  on visit it displays all dynamic content default should be displaying loading until the ui is populated with the real data not static data, and let these pages their navlinks in their nav menu should be same as the manageruser.html code 
in this form it has the fields of Min Balance, Return (Profit),Turn On/Off selection field
-Min Balance the value of this field should pouplate in the user connect-wallet.html page in the Earning Rewards section then the Min Balance Required value 
-Return (Profit)  the value of this field should pouplate in the user connect-wallet.html page in the Earning Rewards section then the Daily Reward value
-Turn On/Off selection: if this feild is turned off no user can visit connect-wallet.html page because when they visit it they are redirected to the dashboard.html page in seconds but if turned on the user's can access the page

