//digital-grownt\frontend\admin\admin-cards.html
admin-cards.html: on visit it displays all dynamic content default should be displaying loading until the ui is populated with the real data not static data, and let these pages their navlinks in their nav menu should be same as the manageruser.html code 
-New Card Type button:  when clicked should lead to the cards-create.html
-in the section that shows the numbers of Pending(user's pending card),Active Cards(user's active cards),Frozen(user's Frozen cards), Card Types(type of card created by admin), these sections should be populated with real-numbers of their category
Card Types tab:-fetches all card created by the admin and each card has edit button and disable button
-when the edit button is clicked it redirects to cards-edit.html page

-when the disable button is clicked and the form submits successfully it redirects back to same page and it displays
Card type disabled.status of the card turns to Inactive then the disable button will turn to enable, on the user apply-card.html page that card disabled won't be fetched/seen anymore, when the enable button is clicked it redirects back to same page and displays Card type enabled.,status of the card changes to active then the card is visible in the user apply-card.html page 

Applications tab(dynamic number count): all the user's card application are fetched here with each having the view button that leads to cards-view.html page

Active tab:all the user's card with the status of active are fetched here with each having the view button that leads to cards-view.html page

Frozen tab: Active tab:all the user's card with the status of frozen are fetched here with each having the view button that leads to cards-view.html page

Rejected tab:Active tab:all the user's card with the status of rejected are fetched here with each having the view button that leads to cards-view.html page

