-if the Freeze Card button is clicked  and the form is submitted successfully, it redirects back to same page and displays
Card frozen.
and the status of the card is changed to frozen while the Freeze Card button and label is changed to Unfreeze Card
-if the Unfreeze Card button is clicked and the form is submitted successfully, it redirects back to same page and it displays Card unfrozen and set to active. and the card status changes to active while the Unfreeze Card button changes to Freeze Card
